          "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: four-view orthographic game asset concept sheet, for LOCAL Hunyuan3D mesh generation and four-view texture projection. Create ONE wide landscape image with FOUR equal panels in a single horizontal row, in the exact order FRONT, LEFT, BACK, RIGHT. Each panel shows the SAME single complete asset, at identical scale and vertically aligned grounded feet/base. True orthographic views at 90 degree rotations, no perspective and no three-quarter view. Entire object fully inside each panel with a generous transparent margin, never cropped. The asset occupies about 80 percent of panel height. Transparent empty background for clean silhouettes, NO panel border, NO labels, NO text, NO cast shadow, NO ground plane. High quality sculpted 3D game art with subtle hand-painted PBR color detail, realistic stylized volume, readable large forms, not low-poly primitives, not photoreal scan. Soft even neutral diffuse lighting across all views; no specular hotspots or dramatic baked shadows. All four views must describe the same form, height, colors and materials coherently. Primary subject: An eroded Chinese fantasy desert sandstone rock formation: one interconnected natural cluster of three uneven rock towers and a broad grounded talus base. Dominant left tower with rounded broken top, lower leaning middle ledge, small right outcrop. Broad horizontal sediment layers, undercut shelves, chipped rounded edges, worn shallow grooves, ochre sandstone with pale beige ridge highlights and restrained cool brown crevices. Irregular organic silhouette; readable large masses and smaller erosion details. Overall width 3.5m, height 3m, depth 2.3m. No columns, rectangular blocks, flat geometric cylinders, architecture, rune, vegetation, snow, lava, or decorative base.",
